Q: Fabric : read parquet files from onelake using openrowset bulk failed A: <p>I found :</p>
<pre class="lang-sql prettyprint-override"><code>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM openrowset(bulk '/Files/tpch_1/lineitem/*.parquet' );
</code></pre>

Q: How to filter column values based on the ending of a string in Excel? A: <p>You could use the <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/left-function-9203d2d2-7960-479b-84c6-1ea52b99640c" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>LEFT</code></a> or <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/right-function-240267ee-9afa-4639-a02b-f19e1786cf2f" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>RIGHT</code></a> formulas to extract respectively the begging and ending of your string:</p>
<pre><code>=RIGHT(&quot;Je ne regrette rien_a&quot;, 2)    # returns &quot;_a&quot;
</code></pre>
